  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the World Bank, the ukraine Relief, Recovery, Reconstrutction and Reform Trustfund (URTF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ukraine Relief, Recovery, Reconstruction and Reform Trust Fund (URTF) is a foundational element of the broader Multi-Donor Resources for Institutions and Infrastructure (MRII) for Ukraine facility. The URTF will channel resources from partners to finance projects and critical analytical and advisory work in line with the WBG&apos;s Approach Paper to support Ukraine. the objective is to provide a coordinated financing and support mechanism to assist the Government of Ukraine (GoU) to sustain its administrative and service delivery capacity and conduct relief efforts and plan implement Ukraine&apos;s recovery and resilent reconstruction. URTF will proviede flexible programming to swiftly respond to Ukraine&apos;s evolving context and needs over an initial 10- year period.</narrative>
  </description>
